       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAINPGM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY ORDREC.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       PROCESS-ORDER.
           CALL "DISCRATE" USING ORD-AMOUNT WS-DISCOUNT-PCT
           COMPUTE WS-NET-AMOUNT =
               ORD-AMOUNT - (ORD-AMOUNT * WS-DISCOUNT-PCT).
